ime in their lives. Ms. Blaine, Please continue to write these. These and the Magical comedies (with a body count) are some of the only books I buy rather than just reading from Kindle Unlimited.\u003cbr /\u003eMarch 2, 2025: Edited for spelling.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3DKE62QFKEJI8\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.G2AK09WHHOLPbgpPtd40Lw\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:2423005":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":2423005,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1545537981p8/2423005._SX200_SY200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1,"textReviewsCount":2252,"name":"Eden","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/2423005-eden","contributor":null,"id":2423005},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.N-aNchuAc3H6t9XtMkBKmw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.N-aNchuAc3H6t9XtMkBKmw","creator":{"__ref":"User:2423005"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1680020629945,"createdAt":1635611263499,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1680020629800,"text":"2021 bk 332. My only gripe with this book is that the cover is so far different from the rest of the books that I truly wondered if I had purchased a book not of the series. This is one of my new favorites. We are introduced to a professional search and rescue diver - one who can work the water to form ice. Ice can be used to block holes in leaking vessels, used as weapons, and preserve what needs to be preserved. Exhausting himself and his talent after an oil spill, a princess of Maine and doctor is called in to heal him. Fun ensues as Jack realizes that Melody is in danger and their healing bond becomes strong. More fun characters.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":null,"likeCount":null,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCoun